# The containerd mirror of the cluster registry (card I6-13), for the Talos machine config of
# every node. NOT applied yet: README "node22 apps on staging" step 3 wires it into
# tofu/cluster/talos.tf (config_patches) with the pull password as a sensitive variable, in a
# card of its own (the plan check, the secret lists and tests/talos-validate.sh change with it).
#
# containerd on the nodes has no cluster DNS: the image name registry.ruum.internal:5000 (the
# chart's runtime.registry, the builder's node registry) goes to the registry Service's fixed
# address (charts/platform values registry.clusterIP). The user ruum-pull may only read
# (charts/platform registry.yaml); its password is STG_REGISTRY_PULL_PASSWORD. Plain HTTP on the
# node network: the password and the images cross it unencrypted (backlog I613-5).
#
# __PULL_PASSWORD__ is replaced by the password when the config is made; never commit the value.
apiVersion: v1alpha1
kind: RegistryMirrorConfig
name: registry.ruum.internal:5000
endpoints:
  - url: http://10.96.0.50:5000
skipFallback: true
---
apiVersion: v1alpha1
kind: RegistryAuthConfig
name: 10.96.0.50:5000
username: ruum-pull
password: __PULL_PASSWORD__
